sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as TodayScreen (on launch)
    participant C as TodayController
    participant R as WorkSessionRepository
    participant DB as SQLite (drift)

    Note over U,DB: App reopened after kill / lock / reboot
    U->>UI: open app
    UI->>C: loadToday()
    C->>R: findOpenSession()
    R->>DB: SELECT WHERE ended_at IS NULL
    DB-->>R: open session (startedAt)
    R-->>C: open session
    C-->>UI: state = running (resumed)
    UI-->>U: live timer from persisted startedAt (no drift, no loss)
